		<item>
		<title>The 2027 warning: Do you understand the real threat from Russia? (Quiz)</title>
		<link>https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/10/12/the-2027-warning-do-you-understand-the-real-threat-from-russia-quiz/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Euromaidan Press Staff]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sat, 11 Oct 2025 21:09:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Quizzes and Infographics]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[quiz]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://euromaidanpress.com/?p=366098</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[The Kremlin is reportedly discussing a potential invasion of NATO countries. Western intelligence agencies have evidence that Russia is considering an attack against the Alliance, says Eurocommissioner for Defense Andrius Kubilius.]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img width="1024" height="717" src="https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Do-you-understand-the-real-threat-from-Russia-1024x717.webp" class="attachment-large size-large wp-post-image" alt="The 2027 warning: Do you understand the real threat from Russia? (Quiz)" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Do-you-understand-the-real-threat-from-Russia-1024x717.webp 1024w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Do-you-understand-the-real-threat-from-Russia-300x210.webp 300w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Do-you-understand-the-real-threat-from-Russia-380x266.webp 380w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Do-you-understand-the-real-threat-from-Russia-800x560.webp 800w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Do-you-understand-the-real-threat-from-Russia-1160x812.webp 1160w, https://euromaidanpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Do-you-understand-the-real-threat-from-Russia.webp 1280w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></p><div data-type="_mgwidget" data-widget-id="1845881"></div>        
        <script>
            (function(w,q){w[q]=w[q]||[];w[q].push(["_mgc.load"])})(window,"_mgq");
        </script>
    <p><strong>This quiz is based on <a target="_blank" href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/10/06/western-intelligence-have-evidence-that-russia-discussing-nato-attack-says-eu-defense-commissioner/" rel="noopener"><span style="color: #ff0000;">Western intelligence have evidence that Russia discussing NATO attack, says EU defense commissioner</span>.</a> </strong><strong>Before taking it we recommend to read this original article by euromaidanpress.com.</strong></p>



<!-- START OF QUIZ CODE -->
