                      </a>
                                      </li>
                  
                        
                                  <li>
                                        
                                        
                      <a href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/10/04/germany-deploys-helicopter-after-military-drones-shut-munich-airport-again/" target="_blank" class="read-also__title">
                        <h3 id="germany-deploys-helicopter-after-military-drones-shut-munich-airport-again">Germany deploys helicopter after “military” drones shut Munich airport again</h3>
                      </a>
                                      </li>
                  
