                      <a href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/05/08/eus-three-year-plan-to-phase-out-russian-gas-is-two-years-too-slow/" target="_blank" class="read-also__title">
                        <h3 id="the-eu-promised-to-cut-russian-gas-now-its-delaying-until-2027">The EU promised to cut Russian gas. Now it’s delaying until 2027</h3>
                      </a>
