                        <h3 id="the-eu-set-out-to-choke-russias-energy-exports-and-handed-putin-a-e30-billion-loophole">The EU set out to choke Russia’s energy exports — and handed Putin a €30 billion loophole</h3>
                      </a>
                                      </li>
                  
                        
