                                  <li>
                                        
                                        
                      <a href="https://euromaidanpress.com/2025/10/10/russian-double-tap-strike-targets-rescue-workers-in-zaporizhzhia/" target="_blank" class="read-also__title">
                        <h3 id="russian-double-tap-strike-targets-rescue-workers-in-zaporizhzhia">Russian double-tap strike targets rescue workers in Zaporizhzhia</h3>
                      </a>
